{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/cbe44dcfa1bae39fe922e5f49171c0af.poster.avif?t=1771698715\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/cbe44dcfa1bae39fe922e5f49171c0af.webm?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/cbe44dcfa1bae39fe922e5f49171c0af.mp4?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abducted. Experimented on. Now it\u2019s time to fight back.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a rebellious young cowboy taken from Earth and trapped inside a labyrinthine alien ship filled with malfunctioning androids. After surviving bizarre experiments, you awaken with a biomechanical arm fused to an evolving alien artifact \u2014 unstable, unpredictable, and your only chance to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/b8dc07a88603dc06eaf6cbd1118fe717.poster.avif?t=1771698715\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/b8dc07a88603dc06eaf6cbd1118fe717.webm?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/b8dc07a88603dc06eaf6cbd1118fe717.mp4?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry a limited-spot weapon arsenal, choose what to keep and what to discard, and combine certain weapon effects for extra damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve the alien artifact and unlock new passive abilities that change your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense third-person bullet-hell combat against waves of drones, robots, and cybernetic bosses attacking from every direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six distinct levels within the alien ship, each with its own threats, enemies, and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the journey of a young Brazilian cowboy fighting for his freedom inside a hostile alien vessel.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/6ee6fefeb95b2e6a2ffeb8a095f9e79c.poster.avif?t=1771698715\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/6ee6fefeb95b2e6a2ffeb8a095f9e79c.webm?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/extras/6ee6fefeb95b2e6a2ffeb8a095f9e79c.mp4?t=1771698715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745430?t=1771698715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/6fc5e81bd51e71102ae181b7fc7c4728849907fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771698715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/f67c52de74c07192ad605687b766d07fe0064ab4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771698715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745430/f67c52de74c07192ad605687b766d07fe0064ab4/caps